Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:05.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)\fs40\fad(150,140)}Flowdish brings margin, stock and food safety\Ninto one operating system.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:14.40,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:08.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Start with current supplier prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:14.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Upload the file, review every proposed change,\Nand catch price drift before it reaches the menu.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:24.60,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:20.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Build dishes from ingredients, yield and portion size,\Nwith a live cost at every level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:24.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Use your own recipes,\Nor start with Coco's proven menus.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:34.30,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:28.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}One click turns the recipe\Ninto an interactive SOP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:34.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}It reads aloud, pauses and repeats hands-free\Nwhile the chef prepares the dish.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:44.80,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:38.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Forecast tomorrow's menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:44.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)\fs42}Flowdish plans the prep, allocates FIFO batches,\Nand turns stock shortfalls into an order list ready to paste.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:54.00,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:48.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}At the back door, photograph the docket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:53.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}AI matches your SKU codes, checks price and VAT,\Nthen updates inventory after review.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:05.30,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:58.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Import the till readout,\Nand sales feed back into stock and margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:05.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)\fs42}The dashboard highlights profit, shortages and expiring batches\Nbefore they become waste.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:09.30,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:09.00,MobileCaption,,0,0,0,,On the floor, each chef enters with a private PIN.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:26.40,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:14.55,MobileCaption,,0,0,0,,During prep, say what was made, then add the\NHACCP time and temperature checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:19.70,MobileCaption,,0,0,0,,"5.6 kilos of short rib"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:24.90,MobileCaption,,0,0,0,,Flowdish drafts the batch, yield and expiry for approval.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:39.80,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:30.10,MobileCaption,,0,0,0,,For waste, say the item, amount and reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:34.20,MobileCaption,,0,0,0,,"Spilled a kilo of coleslaw"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:39.75,MobileCaption,,0,0,0,,Stock changes only after approval,\Nso every loss becomes measurable.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:44.60,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:44.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Monthly points make good recording visible\Nand help teams build the habit.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:52.50,Label,,0,0,0,,ACTUAL FLOWDISH WORKFLOW • SPED UP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:48.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}Cold storage probes and manual checks\Nkeep HACCP evidence together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:52.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1370)}With live history ready when you need it.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:59.70,Summary,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,710)\fs42}• Live prices and precise portion costing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:59.70,Summary,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,835)\fs42}• Batch, expiry and waste control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:59.70,Summary,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\fs42}• AI workflows and HACCP evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:59.80,Accent,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1210)\fs54\fad(180,140)}KNOW EVERY COST. TRACK EVERY BATCH.\NPROVE EVERY CHECK.
